WEBVTT

00:09:28.393 --> 00:09:31.623
Bonnie made a decision
coming into that third morning

00:09:32.772 --> 00:09:34.543
that I was suffering,

00:09:34.567 --> 00:09:37.880
and I was hanging on by a thread.

00:09:38.459 --> 00:09:39.704
And she said, "Come here,"

00:09:39.728 --> 00:09:41.815
and I came close
to the boat, and she said,

00:09:41.839 --> 00:09:43.037
"Look, look out there."

00:09:43.061 --> 00:09:44.214
And I saw light,

00:09:44.238 --> 00:09:46.240
because the day is easier than the night,

00:09:46.264 --> 00:09:48.094
and I thought we were coming into day.

00:09:48.118 --> 00:09:51.776
I saw a stream of white light
along the horizon,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.078
and I said, "It's going
to be morning soon."

00:09:54.102 --> 00:09:57.366
And she said, "No, those
are the lights of Key West."

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.492
It was 15 more hours,